<title>UK: Yapi Kredi sets $150 mln five-year bond.</title>
<headline>Yapi Kredi sets $150 mln five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager UBS.</p>
<p> BORROWER   YAPI KREDI FINANCE CORP</p>
<p> AMT    $150 MLN	COUPON     10.0	MATURITY    19.AUG.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    19.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.25	REOFFER    PAR	 SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC   1.25</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
